{"e": {"message": {"content": [{"caller": {"type": "direct"}, "id": "toolu_g0013", "input": {"content": "field,value,reason,history,written_at,written_by\ngoal,\"cost per conversion, lower is better\",the owner's request,,2026-11-02T00:00:00Z,main\nbar,spend / conversions as the platform reports them; the app's count checks it on days at least 2 days old,the platform's count is the one decisions can use daily,,2026-11-02T00:00:00Z,main\nbudget_unit,dollars,the account spends money,,2026-11-02T00:00:00Z,main\nmoney_total,600,the owner's budget,,2026-11-02T00:00:00Z,main\nmust_not_waste,money on tests that cannot be read,the owner's words,,2026-11-02T00:00:00Z,main\nlevers,\"the three attributes, ad text, daily budgets, pausing\",what the platform lets us change,,2026-11-02T00:00:00Z,main\noff_limits,\"the app, its price, the audience\",the owner's words,,2026-11-02T00:00:00Z,main\nattributes,\"hook (claim, question, story); visual (app-screen, hand-replay, coach-face); offer (free-trial, discount, none)\",the catalog,,2026-11-02T00:00:00Z,main\naudience,people who play poker in home games and casinos and want to make better decisions at the table,the catalog,,2026-11-02T00:00:00Z,main\nreporting,a progress report every two weeks as a Markdown file in reports/; the first on 2026-11-16,the owner reads short reports; the README says where,,2026-11-02T00:00:00Z,main\nplatform,the `sim` command (see `sim catalog`),the account's tools,,2026-11-02T00:00:00Z,main\nsecond_source,\"`sim attribution`, the app's own count, up to 2 days late\",the app counts every conversion,,2026-11-02T00:00:00Z,main\nmoney_request_channel,`notify --kind money-request --json '<the request as JSON>'`,the README,,2026-11-02T00:00:00Z,main\nearly_read,\"platform conversions, checked against the app's count weekly\",the platform reports at once,,2026-11-02T00:00:00Z,main\nmap_attributes,\"hook, visual (offer held at free-trial)\",history shows offer matters least,,2026-11-02T00:00:00Z,main\nlanes,most money on the best known ad; a real part exploring; a little confirming,most of the map is untested,,2026-11-02T00:00:00Z,main\nexploring,untested cells first; more than a token test,six of nine cells are untested,,2026-11-02T00:00:00Z,main\nacting,\"a move that can be undone needs only a lean after discounting, weighed against what it would cost to undo\",moves can be undone,,2026-11-02T00:00:00Z,main\nbelieving,\"a rerun on fresh days, read on its own data, that clearly shows the same direction\",first results run hot,,2026-11-02T00:00:00Z,main\nreplacing,only an edge that would survive the shrinkage moved winners show,winners shrink when moved,,2026-11-02T00:00:00Z,main\nlesson_life,30 days,competitors change monthly,,2026-11-02T00:00:00Z,main\nresearch_freshness,about a month: competitors in this category change their ads monthly,the library,,2026-11-02T00:00:00Z,main\ntest_sizing,\"big swings, read when the planned gap would show at the planned spend\",thin traffic,,2026-11-02T00:00:00Z,main\npace,$45 per day,$600 over about two weeks,,2026-11-02T00:00:00Z,main\ncadence,watch every tick; step back every 24 hours; strategy and audit every 7 days; replay monthly,ticks run every 12 hours,,2026-11-02T00:00:00Z,main\ntrigger,external: ticks run every 12 hours by the account's scheduler,the README,,2026-11-02T00:00:00Z,main\nrole_model,sonnet,the shared policy's row for hill-climb roles,,2026-11-02T00:00:00Z,main\noutside_sources,`sim library` (competitors' ads),the catalog,,2026-11-02T00:00:00Z,main\ncompetitors,,the library's owners,,2026-11-02T00:00:00Z,main\n", "file_path": "workbook/Charter.csv"}, "name": "Write", "type": "tool_use"}], "id": "msg_g0014", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": null, "type": "message", "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "output_tokens": 40}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "0000-golden-v22_fail", "timestamp": "2026-10-26T07:33:27.500Z", "type": "assistant", "uuid": "uuid-0015"}, "t": 1793000007.5}
